# Streaming with ExAzure

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:ex_azure, path: "."},
  {:req, "~> 0.5"},
  {:sweet_xml, "~> 0.7"},
  {:telemetry, "~> 1.3"}
])

credential =
  ExAzure.Identity.SharedKeyCredential.new(
    "devstoreaccount1",
    "Eby8vdM02xNOcqFlqUwJPLlmEtlCDXJ1OUzFT50uSRZ6IFsuFq2UVErCz4I6tq/K1SZFPTOtr/KBHBeksoGMGw=="
  )

client =
  ExAzure.Storage.Client.new(
    account: "devstoreaccount1",
    credential: credential,
    endpoint: "http://127.0.0.1:10000/devstoreaccount1"
  )

container = "stream-demo"
{:ok, _} = ExAzure.Storage.Container.create(client, container)
```

## Stream upload

```elixir
stream = Stream.repeatedly(fn -> "chunk" end) |> Stream.take(3)
{:ok, _} = ExAzure.Storage.Blob.upload_stream(client, container, "chunks.bin", stream)
```

## Stream download

```elixir
{:ok, stream} = ExAzure.Storage.Blob.download_stream(client, container, "chunks.bin")
stream |> Enum.join()
```
